    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῶσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥώννυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strengthening, trength</i>, 
