					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					11.97
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῶσιν εὔξασθαί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					206
				</span></i>
			 (Nubia, ii or <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινὴν ἅπασι πορίζεται ῥῶσιν</span> Chor.in <i><span class="en">
